<p>u<sub>Rw</sub> = √[(RSD<sub>L1</sub>² × (n<sub>L1</sub>-1) + RSD<sub>L2</sub>² × (n<sub>L2</sub>-1)) / (n<sub>L1</sub> + n<sub>L2</sub> - 2)] = √[(${a.toFixed(2)}²×(${(u.l1_n||0)-1}) + ${h.toFixed(2)}²×(${(u.l2_n||0)-1})) / (${(u.l1_n||0)+(u.l2_n||0)}-2)] = <b>${x.toFixed(2)}%</b></p>
